        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>Small Talk Lesson Plan - Blackboard Design and Script</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: {\n    inlineMath: [['$', '$']],\n    displayMath: [['$$', '$$']]\n  }\n};\n</script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  html, body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #ffffff;\n  }\n  body {\n    font-family: \"Trebuchet MS\", \"Segoe UI\", Verdana, sans-serif;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    font-size: 13.5px;\n    line-height: 1.55;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    min-height: 720px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    padding: 18px 44px 26px 52px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    position: relative;\n  }\n  /* corner crop marks visible at top of the scan */\n  .crop-tl, .crop-tr {\n    position: absolute;\n    top: 6px;\n    width: 14px;\n    height: 14px;\n  }\n  .crop-tl { left: 26px; border-left: 1px solid #999; border-top: 1px solid #999; }\n  .crop-tr { right: 22px; border-right: 1px solid #999; border-top: 1px solid #999; }\n\n  p {\n    margin: 0 0 1px 0;\n  }\n  .u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n  .zh {\n    color: #c00000;\n  }\n  .italic {\n    font-style: italic;\n  }\n  .indent {\n    text-indent: 2.2em;\n  }\n  .indent-small {\n    text-indent: 1.6em;\n  }\n  h2.center-title {\n    font-size: 15px;\n    font-weight: bold;\n    text-align: center;\n    margin: 26px 0 16px 0;\n    letter-spacing: 1px;\n  }\n  /* Blackboard design box */\n  .blackboard {\n    width: 262px;\n    height: 100px;\n    border: 1px solid #444;\n    margin: 14px 0 0 6px;\n    padding: 14px 8px 8px 8px;\n    box-sizing: border-box;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-family: \"Times New Roman\", Times, serif;\n    font-size: 8.5px;\n    line-height: 2.2;\n  }\n  .blackboard .bb-title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 9px;\n    margin-bottom: 6px;\n  }\n  .section-label {\n    margin-top: 2px;\n  }\n  .block-gap {\n    height: 12px;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n  <div class=\"crop-tl\"></div>\n  <div class=\"crop-tr\"></div>\n\n  <p>(2) Read the passage for the second time and answer some questions.</p>\n  <p class=\"u\">Q1:What's the small talk?</p>\n  <p>It's a common form of communication.</p>\n  <p class=\"u\">Q2:What's the important thing of the small talk?</p>\n  <p>It is important to smile and keep the conversation light and humorous.</p>\n  <p class=\"section-label\">Step 4:Post-reading</p>\n  <p>Role play: supposing that you are in a new class. And please make a small\n     talk with your classmates.</p>\n  <p class=\"section-label\">Step 5:Summary and homework</p>\n  <p>Summary: Make a summary with the whole class.</p>\n  <p>Homework: Finish the exercises on the book and share what we have\n     learned with your parents.</p>\n  <p class=\"section-label\">5.Blackboard design</p>\n\n  <div class=\"blackboard\">\n    <div class=\"bb-title\">Small talk</div>\n    <div>Q1:What's the small talk?</div>\n    <div>Q2:What's the important thiang about small talk?</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <h2 class=\"center-title\">逐字稿</h2>\n\n  <p><span>Greeting:</span> <span class=\"u\">Hello, everyone, nice to see you again. How was everything</span></p>\n  <p class=\"u\">going? Great? Not bad? I'm so glad to hear that.</p>\n  <p>Warm up:</p>\n  <p class=\"u\">How about singing a song to cheer you up? &lt;We are the world.&gt;</p>\n  <p class=\"italic\">We are the world, we are the children. We are the ones who make a</p>\n  <p class=\"italic\">brighter day. So let's start giving.</p>\n  <p class=\"u\">OK, are you happy now? It's time for class.</p>\n\n  <div class=\"block-gap\"></div>\n\n  <p>Lead-in：</p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">I watched a very interesting video and now I want to share it with\n     you.<span class=\"zh\">(视频导入)</span> Do you want to see it? Well, let's look at the PPT. <span class=\"zh\">(手指屏幕)</span></p>\n  <p>What can you see in the video?</p>\n  <p class=\"indent-small\"><span class=\"u\">Yes, some people. Who are they? Yes, they are some businessmen.</span></p>\n  <p class=\"u\">What are they doing? Right, they are chatting with one another before</p>\n  <p class=\"u\">having a meeting, and the topic they are talking about is very funny, so the</p>\n  <p class=\"u\">atmosphere is relaxing, right? We call it small talk. Do you know why they</p>\n  <p><span class=\"u\">do so before such an important and serious meeting?</span><span class=\"zh\">(互动引导到主题)</span></p>\n  <p class=\"indent\">Well, today we will learn something about this. We will learn <span class=\"u\">small</span></p>\n  <p><span class=\"u\">talk.</span><span class=\"zh\">(板书标题)</span></p>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
